					"Code": "float3 c = saturate(VC);\nAO = lerp(1.0, saturate(Cavity), saturate(CavityAO));\nreturn lerp(c, pow(max(c, 1e-6), 2.2), saturate(SrgbDecode));",
					"Description": "VertexDecode: vertex colour -> base, cavity -> AO"
